                    "default": [
                        {
                            "name": "Lugas Mondo Satrio",
                            "position": "President Director",
                            "photo": "themes/cdt/assets/Lugas_2-1025x1536.jpg-DPfoNaI3.webp",
                            "quote": "Digitalization is a must, and transformation is a necessity, while technology is the key to survival. Technology also serves as a catalyst for encouraging sustainable growth in the face of tougher and fiercer business competition. The faster the company adopts technology, the faster the exchange of information, the wider the market reach, the better it is to provide services, and the more efficient it is to manage resources.",
                            "content": "<p>Responding to business needs as well as technological advances, CDT focuses on three main solution areas in response to technological advances: <strong class=\"font-bold text-gray-800\">Observability, Security, and Cloud.</strong> We call it the Three Waves of Catalyst. Observability is a technology that must be owned by companies, considering that every technology requires collaboration and interconnection, thereby increasing the complexity of the people, systems, and processes involved in interactions.</p><p>Meanwhile, Security is required as an equally important component in protecting sensitive and crucial assets to prevent the company from digital theft and fraud... Lastly, we integrate Cloud technology into the solution mix to provide added value without sacrificing efficiency. With CDT, we aim to expedite your digital transformation journey for sustainable business growth.</p>",
                            "linkedin_url": "#"
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "Fenny",
                            "position": "Director",
                            "photo": "themes/cdt/assets/Fenny_3-1025x1536.jpg-C5J6V2NR.webp",
                            "quote": "CDT is a company with more than ten years of experience in IT, especially in the Enterprise market. Business demands and rapid market changes make CDT transform into an efficient company with future-oriented technology and continue to innovate to build an ecosystem that grows sustainably and transparently.",
                            "content": "<p>As a manifestation of what we had planned, CDT succeeded in building Cloud technology competence and achieved the best AWS Advanced Consulting Partner in 2022. CDT has more than 500 customers, 150 of them Cloud-based ones, both from home and abroad. It doesn\u2019t stop there; CDT is also innovating by launching a single cloud dashboard which we named <strong class=\"font-bold text-gray-800\">Nebula Cloud Console (NCC)</strong> in August 2022.</p><p>With a work culture that upholds Integrity, Humble, and Strives for Excellence, CDT continues to provide breakthroughs for its customers on their digital transformation journey. Not only experience, but CDT also has broad competencies, a reliable team of certified technicians, and an ecosystem network that can synergize to create complete and comprehensive solutions in almost all industrial sectors.</p>",
                            "linkedin_url": "#"
                        }
                    ]
                }
